//  concepts: HAVING · WHERE · order of evaluation
//  run: node 08-having-vs-where.js
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//
//  WHERE filters rows BEFORE they are grouped. HAVING filters the groups
//  AFTER. They are not interchangeable and they do not compete — most real
//  reports use both, and each one changes a different number.
//
