//      repeatCustomers(db, 2)                       → 4 customers
//      repeatCustomersSince(db, '2024-03-01', 2)    → 1 customer
//
//  hint: WHERE cannot see COUNT(*) — the counting has not happened yet, and
//  sqlite will tell you so in those words.

